<li id="bib.bib25" class="ltx_bibitem ltx_bib_inproceedings"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_bib_author-year ltx_role_refnum ltx_tag_bibitem">Zhou <span class="ltx_text ltx_bib_etal">et al.</span> (2022)</span>
<span class="ltx_bibblock"><span class="ltx_text ltx_bib_author">W. Zhou, C. Xu, and J. McAuley</span>
</span>
<span class="ltx_bibblock"><span class="ltx_text ltx_bib_title">BERT learns to teach: knowledge distillation with meta learning</span>.
</span>
