<section id="A4.SS2" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">D.2 </span>Efficiency and resource overhead</h3>

<div id="A4.SS2.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A4.SS2.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Since DWA-KD includes a sequence-level Soft-DTW objective, we additionally report step time and GPU memory usage measured under the same sequence length regime as our main experiments. Table <a href="#A4.T7" title="Table 7 ‣ D.2 Efficiency and resource overhead ‣ Appendix D Additional Experiments ‣ DWA-KD: Dual-Space Weighting and Time-Warped Alignment for Cross-Tokenizer Knowledge Distillation" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">7</span></a> shows that DWA-KD incurs only a modest overhead compared to common GPU-based CTKD baselines (DSKD, MinED, ULD) at batch size 4, while remaining substantially more efficient than CPU-based CDM in its supported batch-size-1 setting.</p>
</div>
<figure id="A4.T7" class="ltx_table">
<table id="A4.T7.2" class="ltx_tabular ltx_centering ltx_guessed_headers ltx_align_middle">
<tbody class="ltx_tbody">
<tr id="A4.T7.2.1" class="ltx_tr">
<th id="A4.T7.2.1.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_th ltx_th_row ltx_border_tt">Method</th>
<td id="A4.T7.2.1.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_border_tt">Avg Mem (GB)</td>
<td id="A4.T7.2.1.3" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_border_tt">Peak Mem (GB)</td>
<td id="A4.T7.2.1.4" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_border_tt">Step time (s)</td></tr>
<tr id="A4.T7.2.2" class="ltx_tr">
<th id="A4.T7.2.2.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_th ltx_th_row ltx_border_t" colspan="4"><span id="A4.T7.2.2.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Batch size 4</span></th></tr>
<tr id="A4.T7.2.3" class="ltx_tr">
<th id="A4.T7.2.3.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_th ltx_th_row ltx_border_t">DSKD</th>
<td id="A4.T7.2.3.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_border_t">20.11</td>
<td id="A4.T7.2.3.3" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_border_t">26.38</td>
<td id="A4.T7.2.3.4" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_border_t">0.35</td></tr>
<tr id="A4.T7.2.4" class="ltx_tr">
<th id="A4.T7.2.4.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_th ltx_th_row">MinED</th>
<td id="A4.T7.2.4.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center">19.63</td>
<td id="A4.T7.2.4.3" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center">22.29</td>
<td id="A4.T7.2.4.4" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center">0.42</td></tr>
<tr id="A4.T7.2.5" class="ltx_tr">
<th id="A4.T7.2.5.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_th ltx_th_row">ULD</th>
<td id="A4.T7.2.5.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center">19.63</td>
